SUMMARY:Part Closure: WINDRUSH LINE: Saturday 5\, all day\, and Sunday 6 
 September\, until 1915\, no service between Surrey Quays and Clapham 
 Junction / Battersea Park. There will also be no SOUTHERN trains at Queens
  Road Peckham and Peckham Rye. Replacement bus service M operates between 
 Canada Water and Clapham Junction via Surrey Quays\, Queens Road Peckham\,
  Peckham Rye\, Denmark Hill\, Clapham High Street and Wandsworth Road. In 
 addition\, replacement buses operate between London Bridge and Tulse Hill 
 via South Bermondsey\, Queens Road Peckham\, Peckham Rye\, East Dulwich\, 
 North Dulwich and Herne Hill.
